        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "To a methanolic solution of LH (1,3-bis(2-methoxyphenyl)propane-1,3-dione) and pivalic acid (pivH) was added GdCl3·6H2O and the mixture was stirred at room temperature for 10 min. Triethylamine was added dropwise and stirring was continued for 12 h at room temperature, giving a pale yellow precipitate that was washed with methanol, dried, and redissolved in CH3CN/MeOH. Pale yellow block crystals suitable for X-ray crystallography were obtained by slow evaporation of the solvent mixture under aerobic conditions.",
